[06:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'list of hints from which you can choose an option. In many ways, like LazyVim for those of you who know it. This will give you faster access to basic commands, moving between layouts, scrolling mode, and more. But wait, press T,'

